  "interpretation": "<p>Detected: Indicates t(4;14)(p16;q32) translocation<br>Associated with poor prognosis in MM</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1128\">Clinical Significance</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1215\">\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1215\">The <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1157\">t(4;14)(p16;q32)</strong> translocation results in the <strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1214\">fusion of FGFR3 and IgH</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1278\">This is observed in ~15% of <strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1271\">Multiple Myeloma (MM)</strong> cases.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1392\">\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1297\">Associated with:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1392\">\n<li data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1322\">\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1322\"><strong data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1322\">Poorer prognosis</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1392\">\n<p data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1392\">May benefit from <strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1369\">proteasome inhibitors</strong> (e.g., <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1391\">bortezomib</strong>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
